The Nun is a 2018 American gothic supernatural horror film directed by Corin Hardy and
written by Gary Dauberman, from a story by Dauberman and James Wan.

11
00:42:14,400 --> 00:42:20,400
It serves as a spiritual spin-off to The Conjuring 2 and is the
fifth installment in The Conjuring shared universe.

12
00:46:04,800 --> 00:46:10,800
The film stars Taissa Farmiga, Demián Bichir and Jonas Bloquet, with Bonnie Aarons reprising
her role as the Demon Nun, an incarnation of Valak, from The Conjuring 2.

13
00:49:55,200 --> 00:50:01,200
The plot follows a Roman Catholic priest and a nun in her novitiate
as they uncover an unholy secret in 1952 Romania.

14
00:53:45,599 --> 00:53:51,599
It has a sequel, The Nun II, released in 2023.

