01:01:26,400 --> 01:01:32,400
Pictures and New Line Cinema announced The Nun, a spin-off film to The Conjuring 2,
which had opened five days earlier, with Peter Safran and Wan producing.

17
01:05:16,800 --> 01:05:22,800
The film's initial script was by David Leslie Johnson.

18
01:09:07,199 --> 01:09:13,199
Hardy had signed on to direct The Nun with a new
screenplay by Wan and Dauberman.

19
01:12:57,600 --> 01:13:03,600
Principal photography began in May 2017 in Bucharest, Romania.

20
01:16:48,000 --> 01:16:54,000
The Nun was released in the United States on September 7, 2018.

21
01:20:38,400 --> 01:20:44,400
It received mixed reviews and grossed $366 million worldwide off a $22 million budget, becoming
the highest-grossing film of the Conjuring series at the time of its release.

22
